{"id":"rp168","designation":"RP 168","title":"Definition of Vertical Interval Switching Point for Synchronous Video Switching","state":"stabilized","suite":null,"official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/rp168/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/rp168/","checked_at":"2026-11-18"},"scope":"This practice defines the line number and line timing for the switching point of serial digital and analog interfaces carrying television and data payloads to minimize any disturbance in the active payload area. The switching point location is defined for uncompressed television interfaces operating with composite or component signals, where the payload signals may be in analog or digital format.","outline":[],"definitions":[],"keywords":[{"term":"Vertical Blanking Interval","zh":"场消隐期","abbr":"","category":"tv","source":"curated"},{"term":"HDTV","zh":"","abbr":"HDTV","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"SDTV","zh":"","abbr":"SDTV","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"VITC","zh":"","abbr":"VITC","category":"other","source":"acronym"}],"refs":[],"cited_by":[{"id":"ov292-0","designation":"OV 292-0"},{"id":"rdd19","designation":"RDD 19"},{"id":"rdd33","designation":"RDD 33"},{"id":"rdd6","designation":"RDD 6"},{"id":"rp165","designation":"RP 165"},{"id":"rp2005","designation":"RP 2005"},{"id":"rp207","designation":"RP 207"},{"id":"rp214","designation":"RP 214"},{"id":"rp223","designation":"RP 223"},{"id":"rp291-2","designation":"RP 291-2"},{"id":"st12-1","designation":"ST 12-1"},{"id":"st12-2","designation":"ST 12-2"},{"id":"st125","designation":"ST 125"},{"id":"st2010","designation":"ST 2010"},{"id":"st2016-3","designation":"ST 2016-3"},{"id":"st2016-4","designation":"ST 2016-4"},{"id":"st2020-1","designation":"ST 2020-1"},{"id":"st2022-8","designation":"ST 2022-8"},{"id":"st2038","designation":"ST 2038"},{"id":"st2041-1","designation":"ST 2041-1"},{"id":"st2041-2","designation":"ST 2041-2"},{"id":"st2051","designation":"ST 2051"},{"id":"st2064